# The public repository holds only what the app needs to run and to be built, plus README.md and
# LICENSE (phageo, 2026-11-18). Everything else stays on the build PC: it is ignored here by default
# and only the whitelist below is let in. (Ignored on purpose, among others: CLAUDE.md, CHANGELOG.md,
# CONTRIBUTING.md, SECURITY.md, .github/, .claude/, docs/ - with docs/memory/ and docs/benchmark/ -,
# tests/, yara_rules/ and the tools that are not listed.)
/*
!/README.md
!/LICENSE
!/THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.txt
!/.gitignore
!/.gitattributes
!/GameSafetyScanner.pyw
!/Run Scanner.bat
!/gamescan/

# assets: the two icon pictures only
!/assets/
/assets/*
!/assets/icon/
/assets/icon/*
!/assets/icon/bagel_ai.png
!/assets/icon/bagel_pixel.png

# tools: the build and package tools only
!/tools/
/tools/*
!/tools/build_package.py
!/tools/fetch.py
!/tools/source_form.py
!/tools/move_indicators.py
!/tools/indicator_select.bin
!/tools/build_launcher.py
!/tools/launcher/
!/tools/build_installer.py
!/tools/build_icon.py
!/tools/manifest_package.json
!/tools/manifest_spike.json

# Python caches (they hold absolute paths of the PC that ran the code)
__pycache__/
*.py[co]

# built locally, never committed
/tools/launcher/Bagel.exe
*.zip
*-setup.exe
*.csv
